<title>USA: Breed names Robert Fincher interim CFO.</title>
<headline>Breed names Robert Fincher interim CFO.</headline>
<dateline>LAKELAND, Fla. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>BREED Technologies Inc said Monday that its chief financial officer, Edward McFadden, has left the company to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that Robert Fincher, vice-president of finance, will fill the position on an interim basis.</p>
<p>BREED specializes in automobile safety technology such as air-bag parts.</p>
